925
01:27:17.649 --> 01:27:18.941
<font color="violet">(GROANS)</font>

926
01:28:23.756 --> 01:28:25.841
- نزیکە تەواو؟

927
01:28:29.762 --> 01:28:31.638
<font color="violet">(CAR APPROACHING)</font>

928
01:28:31.806 --> 01:28:33.682
- گوێت لێ بوو؟

929
